@startuml
title Figure 5.2 – Simplified RaSTA Communication State Machine

[*] --> Disconnected

state Disconnected
state Connection_Establishment
state Operational
state Fault_State
state Recovery

Disconnected --> Connection_Establishment : Connection Request

Connection_Establishment --> Operational : Session Established

Operational --> Fault_State : CRC Error
Operational --> Fault_State : Sequence Error
Operational --> Fault_State : Timeout
Operational --> Fault_State : Invalid Endpoint
Operational --> Fault_State : Communication Loss

Fault_State --> Recovery : Recovery Attempt

Recovery --> Operational : Success
Recovery --> Disconnected : Failure

Operational --> Disconnected : Shutdown

@enduml